INT. SYNERGY PARTNERS - OPEN OFFICE - FRIDAY, 4:55 PM

Beanbags. A kombucha tap. A neon sign reads "GOOD VIBES ONLY." Under it, five exhausted people.

BRANDEN CHASE (30s, quarter-zip, gelled hair) stands at a whiteboard that says "SYNERGY 2.0 - ALIGN. PIVOT. ELEVATE."

PRIYANKA MENON (30s, headphones, eye bags) slumps at her desk. DESMOND "DEZ" WILLIAMS (40s, cardigan, thermos) chews a pen. CALLIE ZIMMERMAN (20s, intern, notebook) sits upright, vibrating. And MR. HOLLOWAY (60s, regional VP, face on a video call projected on the wall) frowns from a rectangle.

BRANDEN
Okay team, quick pulse check before the weekend.

PRIYANKA
(muttering)
There is no pulse.

HOLLOWAY (V.O.)
(from the screen)
I can't hear you, Priyanka.

PRIYANKA
I said I'm thrilled.

BRANDEN
Dez, the Q3 deck?

DEZ
Done.

BRANDEN
Done done, or "done" done?

DEZ
Done in the sense that I'll never open it again.

CALLIE
I made a mood board!

BRANDEN
Callie, love the energy.

PRIYANKA
(to Callie, low)
Save it. They'll sell it back to you.

HOLLOWAY (V.O.)
Someone mentioned the layoffs?

BRANDEN
No one mentioned layoffs, sir.

HOLLOWAY (V.O.)
Because I'm seeing a rumor.

DEZ
(to himself)
I'm seeing a door.

BRANDEN
Team, let's take a breath.

PRIYANKA
Everyone breathing? Great. Branden, are we getting cut?

BRANDEN
I can't speak to that.

PRIYANKA
You can speak to everything else.

DEZ
He's mute on the one subject that matters.

CALLIE
Is this a good time to share my mood board?

HOLLOWAY (V.O.)
Callie, was it? We'll circle back.

BRANDEN
Okay. Okay. Let's all just, you know, honor the process.

PRIYANKA
The process has a sign-off sheet?

DEZ
Process is a verb, Priyanka. We are the object.

HOLLOWAY (V.O.)
I'll let you all go early. Happy weekend.

The screen goes black. Nobody moves.

BRANDEN
(brightly)
Great sync, everyone.

He erases "ELEVATE" with his sleeve. Callie slowly closes her notebook.

DEZ
(to himself)
I'm going to miss the kombucha.
